<title>JAPAN: Greek Railways launches 4.5% samurai bonds - Daiwa. [CORRECTED 05:55 GMT]</title>
<headline>Greek Railways launches 4.5% samurai bonds - Daiwa. [CORRECTED 05:55 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following samurai issue was announced by lead-manager Daiwa Securities on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    BORROWER Greek Railways Organisation (OSE)</p>
<p>    AMT	8.7 bln yen</p>
<p>    COUPON   4.5 pct</p>
<p>    MATURITY 6 Dec 2016 (corrects from 6 Dec 2006)</p>
<p>    TYPE		samurai</p>
<p>    ISS PRICE	 par</p>
<p>    PAY DATE	  6 Dec 1996</p>
<p>    SUB PERIOD	Dec 2 to Dec 5</p>
<p>    PAY FREQ	  Semi-annual</p>
<p>    LAST RATING     JBRI A</p>
<p>    LEAD MANAGER    Daiwa Securities</p>
<p>    LEAD TRUSTEE    Nippon Credit Bank</p>
</text>
